data modify storage mineparty:main quips.helper.random set value ["Protip: Don't know what a tile does? Get a Tile Inspector! You can get one from me!","Protip: Don't know whose turn it is? Ask me for the turn order, and player taking their turn will be marked with a >.","Protip: Watch out for the Warden...","Did you know that the music industry has less gross revenue than the \u00a7ocheese\u00a7r industry? Let that fact ferment in your thoughts...","My grandma is watching this game. Hi grandma!","This dice I'm holding doubles as a smartphone.","If you ever come in contact with a chimpanzee, smile with your teeth so they know you're friendly! Also run at them directly so they know you want to play!","Mumph hmph yomph... Don't mind me, just eating my lunch... Schrompf hompf...","I'm 3 years old!","...","I feel so sigma!","I am physically incapable of thinking.","You shall now blink manually.","Look! I managed to pronounce :) !","I wanna go home... My pc...","Don't worry about taking your time, I'm playing Balatro right now anyways.","going afk rq","\u00a7aI'm so green!","Anybody wanna go get ice cream after this?","Oh wow! Have you been working out? This message is only visible to you by the way.","Eureka! Oh, forget I said that...","I'm having pizza for dinner! Jealous?",":3","It is not the one who has too little, but the one who craves more, that is poor.","*cough*","They say that even long after a path has been crossed, the tracks may still remain.","Guys... I just found out where babies come from... you don't wanna know...","Woah. WOAH.","I wish I was old enough to bet on this game.","At what point are we not even playing Minecraft anymore?","Have any of you seen my wallet? It's pink and looks like a dinosaur.","Can the person with the white Nissan park their car somehwere else? Thank you.","I wish, therefore I will be.","My pillow takes up half the bed.","I wrote all the rulebooks by the way. It takes LONG when you're my size.","*Yawn* When is naptime again?"]

